<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonld={jsonld} navVariant="inner">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Cluster — 72-hour response</span>
<h1>Furniture inspection &amp; supplier verification in Kolkata</h1>
<p class="lead">Cane, rattan and natural-fibre furniture from the eastern belt. Full cluster guide publishing soon—every Qualis service is available here now, with 72-hour response.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/defects/"><h3>Material treatment</h3><p>Untreated or under-treated cane invites borer and mould in transit — treatment verification is check one.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/container-loading-supervision/"><h3>Mould in transit</h3><p>Natural fibre plus container humidity: desiccant plans and moisture checks are non-negotiable.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Weave consistency</h3><p>Hand-woven surfaces vary by weaver; sampling breadth matters more here than anywhere.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><p class="prose rv">Kolkata and the eastern belt supply the natural-fibre end of the range: cane, rattan, seagrass and combinations with wood frames. The defining risks are biological—treatment, moisture and mould—which makes pre-shipment and loading checks a pair here.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Pre-Shipment Inspection</h3><p>AQL 2.5, moisture, structure, finish vs golden sample — report in 24h.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Supplier Verification</h3><p>Unannounced premises visits, verdict in 3–5 working days.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/factory-audit-india/"><h3>Factory Audit</h3><p>8-section scored audit for programme onboarding.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/container-loading-supervision/"><h3>Container Loading Supervision</h3><p>Tally, dunnage, weather hold and photographed seal.</p></a></div></div></section>
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">

<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
</div>
</section>
